#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The KPD is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: Class struggle, preparing the proletariat for a world revolution, and establishing a permanent revolution are our primary goals.
- @centrist: The word of Stalin and the Comintern remains the best way to steer our path forwards.
- @labor: We should try and create left-unity where possible, focusing on pragmatic governance and better working conditions over dogma.
- @reform: We should empower the RGO and advocate for the empowerment of works councils.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
//trotskyists
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 10; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; z_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; kpd_relation += 1

The Trotskyists within the party represent the left opposition, guided by the theory of permanent revolution and workers democracy.

@centrist
//stalinists
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5; kpd_relation -= 5

The Stalinists, principally represented by Ernst Thälmann, uphold loyalty to Moscow first and foremost, believing the SPD to be "Social Fascists".

@labor
//concillators
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 10; wtb_support += 1; labor_dissent -= 5; kpd_relation += 5

The conciliatory wing of the party is against sectarian left-wing infighting, represented by veterans such as Ernst Meyer and Arthur Ewert. Advocating for a United front with the SPD both in the streets and Reichstag.

@reform
//labour
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 10; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; kpd_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Labour faction, made up of syndicalists and RGO union members believe that real power lies in factory councils rather than parliamentary politics.

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
